      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, they don't even miss me. if they did, they'd notice. there's just this huge silence where i used to be. it's like the world just collectively decided i wasn't part of it anymore. it actually feels more peaceful to just accept it, like... if i'm already a ghost, why am i still fighting so hard to be a person? it just seems exhausting.",
